    30 00 39 36 30 30 30 00 31 37 36 34 30 30 00 31  0.96000.176400.1
  backtrace (crc 6cdecf20):
    kmemleak_alloc_recursive include/linux/kmemleak.h:44 [inline]
    slab_post_alloc_hook mm/slub.c:4597 [inline]
